{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And YHWH said.</b> To Abraham — because he did as He said, that He would not conceal from him." "<b>Because great.</b> Every רַבָּה in Scripture has its accent downward, on the bet — because they are translated גְּדוֹלָה or גְּדֵלָה וְהוֹלֶכֶת. But this one's accent is upward, on the resh — because it is translated גָדְלָה כְּבָר, as I explained in ״וְהָיָה הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ בָּאָה הִנֵּה שָׁבָה יְבִמְתֵּךְ״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:18.108421830Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}